  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Fedora has a placeholder in FOXML for the concept of",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "selective datastream versioning. This is in the form",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "of the \"versionable\" attribute on a datastream. Up",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "until Fedora 2.1.1 datastreams are versioned",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "automatically, and every datastream is subject to such",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "versioning. This new feature will allow for",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "versioning on whatever datastreams are marked as",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"versionable.\" A new API-M method will allow a client",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "to set the versionable attribute on a datastream by",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "datastream basis. The default is that datastreams are",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "versioned. If a datastream was previously set as",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"versionable\" and at a later time it is set to not be",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"versionable\" the version history will not be purged,",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "it will just stop the versioning from that point on. ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "This is very beneficial to avoid excessive or",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "superfluous versioning for datastream that it is not",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "necessary or desirable to version. The choice to",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "version or not is made by each repository administrator.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
